<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_4a744538-9d51-4427-8487-076940701163"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9d902aaf-9289-4dfe-b174-74b52d5d23f3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_1310eb7b-6e89-4b4c-a1a8-c9ed571a8304"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-def.function"><b><i>function</i></b></defterm> includes a
power, authority or duty, and <defterm type="definition"
guid="_e1332990-2b54-4259-9498-19e6ab5b249f"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-def.exercise"><b><i>exercise</i></b></defterm> a function
includes perform a duty.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_ac911030-5508-4fb9-b2b7-0190669e467c"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-def.Fund"><b><i>Fund</i></b></defterm> means the Digital
Restart Fund established under section 5.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c8ba54e3-af65-419a-af6b-217c77a60e5d"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-def.governmentagency"><b><i>government
agency</i></b></defterm> means&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_201f4fde-d551-4422-be85-7b8a80508e9b" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a government sector agency within the meaning of
the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-2013-040"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Employment Act 2013</i></name></legref>,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b1dd49ea-f4fd-42a9-af70-b72906c767c1" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a statutory body representing the Crown,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7444208a-d838-419e-8ced-71c721ca1d22" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a State owned corporation within the meaning of
the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-1989-134"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>State Owned Corporations Act 1989</i></name></legref>,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_457add27-0162-4b5a-9e0b-a4e7dd5e8c65" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any other public authority constituted by or
under an Act, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3662e575-d779-40cc-b587-ece3ab046058" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any person or body declared by the regulations to
be a government agency.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></deflist>
</block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_c9e57327-e194-4e7f-b313-ef65cae05b29"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note"><heading guid="_b3d9c629-eed6-4def-965c-e8d44e9a8ed4"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note-he"><b>Note.</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW"
check="unknown" refid="act-1987-015"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Interpretation
Act 1987</i></name></legref> contains definitions and other provisions that
affect the interpretation and application of this Act.</txt></block></note>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d006c980-7117-4e8d-856a-0b1af13c8dfd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Notes included in this Act do not form part of
this Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0e8672b5-1c62-42c2-ba58-bce464fa3188"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_29474bec-9f6e-4295-92d5-c961353c4ad4"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Object of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The object of this Act is to provide funding for
digital and information and communications technology
initiatives&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6e83eec9-ab35-490f-8d4b-35aea323b0b7" id="sec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to improve the delivery of services by government
agencies, including improving interactions between members of the public and
government agencies involving digital and information and communications
technology, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2fe22473-e917-4681-a010-76bcb8d1eef2" id="sec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to facilitate whole of government digital
transformation, including upgrading and standardising systems and processes
used by government agencies, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ba4dc3bf-a593-4b4d-bb5c-cf6f0aa1e8c8" id="sec.4-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to improve operational and cost efficiencies
across the government sector.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_40194011-b5c7-4685-a5e4-178fd8d5e4ce"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_74758e48-b11a-4878-8e6c-ad33b538ac0a"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Digital Restart Fund</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bb844a64-c66f-45b7-a19f-a2bc85276f93"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_44196665-4bf7-4de8-a6e0-d153223c4c46"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Establishment of Digital Restart Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A Digital Restart Fund is to be established in
the Special Deposits Account.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_29173f75-b409-43ff-896f-e102f9ce520b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_764cc56d-5202-49f6-b2c3-cca48bc2bed4"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Purpose of Digital Restart Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The purpose of the Fund is to support digital and
information and communications technology initiatives across the government
sector, and for that purpose, to fund projects that&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4ef7a45f-6004-4a2d-bb67-72d7431aca1e" id="sec.6-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">develop and implement digital and information and
communications technology products or services that, for the purpose of
improving the delivery of services by government agencies and related
interactions&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_04f1482a-9204-4d7d-9394-0fcd7d42b472" id="sec.6-para1.a-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">identify the actions required to be taken by an
individual (or on the individual&#8217;s behalf) in respect of significant
events during the individual&#8217;s life, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fe691fec-5d77-460c-a260-081900fac2e6" id="sec.6-para1.a-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">record related interactions between the
individual (or on the individual&#8217;s behalf) and government agencies or
non-government entities or other bodies or persons connected with the delivery
of services by a government agency, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0e208b79-a318-4ddd-abfb-16565d441896" id="sec.6-para1.a-para2.iii">
<no>(iii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">identify impediments to the delivery of related
services by government agencies and develop and implement solutions to those
impediments, or</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_52659e4c-5c09-4d33-883f-61960db4f57a" id="sec.6-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">develop and implement digital and information and
communications technology products or services that are capable of being used
by multiple government agencies in a cost effective manner,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_24ee1e99-5e3b-4234-a3a1-d0d055743a24" id="sec.6-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">optimise existing technologies, applications,
computer systems or processes used by government agencies to improve the
functionality and operational life of those technologies, applications,
computer systems or processes, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6be2fc4f-696b-437f-b670-a41e020b545d" id="sec.6-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">provide persons employed in or by a government
agency with education, training and information relating to digital and
information and communications technology.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c3fe8019-fc04-4fe5-a765-267b5b9ef1cf"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_70dc5d8e-5e0b-4c49-98b5-48cd62c55026"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Control and management of Digital Restart
Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is to control and manage the
Fund.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2d11cb95-0583-489b-82de-f111ecac7de5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_f72cea56-0a11-4b35-805b-fda4a22854b5"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Payments into Digital Restart Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dc9e3fe4-9f3d-4dbf-b58f-15c29b0dc8bc"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">There is payable into the Fund the
following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_12d6fb0f-00ac-47c2-821a-61768320cde7" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money appropriated by Parliament, or advanced
by the Treasurer, for the purposes of payment into the
Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a24040dd-8ced-4916-847f-b11e67024980" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money appropriated by Parliament to the
Treasurer for the general purposes of the Government and directed by the
Treasurer to be paid into the Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c26bffcf-c24a-4ace-b6aa-e0396e8cd218" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the proceeds of the investment of money in the
Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1da6a9f2-b466-4169-be9a-0008dadb7cb1" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all other money directed or authorised to be paid
into the Fund by or under any Act or other law,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_830ead99-eef5-4dd9-a27c-2d0ec09f9c5b" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money received from voluntary contributions
to the Fund made by a government agency or other person or
body.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_40a0b87c-88c1-4fdb-9347-eea3eb61666e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">To avoid doubt, money appropriated by Parliament
before the commencement of this section for purposes that reflect the purpose
of the Fund may be paid into the Fund.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ca6dd974-9e9c-4e96-9096-43184c6e8503"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Money paid into the Fund under subsection (2) is
taken to have been appropriated out of the Consolidated Fund for the purposes
of payment into the Fund.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ae906c5b-bd81-40ab-9411-397b4d30da51"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Government agencies are authorised by this
section to make voluntary contributions to the Fund.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ce566902-d706-44d8-aaa9-0eeef2d61526"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_8ebf7468-8675-4099-b3a7-c15239c90a61"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Payments from Digital Restart Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">There is payable from the Fund the
following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7ef34c53-f47a-42d4-904f-56c240414f04" id="sec.9-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">money required to fund all or part of the cost of
a project that promotes the purpose of the Fund and is approved by the
Minister on the recommendation of the Secretary of the Department of Customer
Service,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f1e0112e-9e2f-4aab-9924-68627eae5b64" id="sec.9-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">money required to meet administrative expenses
related to the Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a422eb18-4ffb-4927-928b-99cd4c5cacc8" id="sec.9-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">money directed or authorised to be paid from the
Fund by or under this Act or any other Act or law.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_df59e196-bf09-47d0-b14a-e67a828897fa"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_f0ffae04-1f7b-455b-b210-f8885feb08ce"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Requirement for Minister to obtain
advice</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Before approving the payment of money under
section 9(a), the Minister must obtain and have regard to advice from the
Information Commissioner and the Privacy Commissioner as to the effect, if
any, that the project may have on&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f7b777de-cc48-433f-8207-ee23fa97d054" id="sec.10-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">access to government information under the
<legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-2009-052"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Government Information (Public Access) Act
2009</i></name></legref>, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d9a7c1eb-28f9-4260-b4c0-354e7bec0386" id="sec.10-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the protection of personal information under the
<legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-1998-133"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Privacy and Personal Information Protection Act
1998</i></name></legref> or health information under the <legref type="act"
jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-2002-071"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Health Records and Information Privacy Act
2002</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7eed1cff-c31e-4071-9a39-88acd1db2a12"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_82ff347e-e995-4087-8d2b-379324004e26"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Investment of money in Digital Restart
Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2ac3ecc1-dad6-4ee5-9c3f-c4b14221be0f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may invest money in the
Fund&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f2fe75ed-2b1c-4a94-ba1e-bbec92f2f999" id="sec.11-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the Minister is a GSF agency for the purposes
of Part 6 of the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"
refid="act-2018-055"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>&#8212;in any way that the Minister is permitted to
invest money under that Part, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_227ddd46-ff53-455f-b0c4-47504781125a" id="sec.11-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the Minister is not a GSF agency for the
purposes of Part 6 of the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"
refid="act-2018-055"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>&#8212;in any way approved by the
Treasurer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3f313e21-a7ea-4699-9c2d-c789280c3386"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section, <defterm type="definition"
guid="_925f544e-c058-4cbb-aaf0-cf1c6c47deb6"
id="sec.11-ssec.2-def.GSFagency"><b><i>GSF agency</i></b></defterm> has the
same meaning as in the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"
refid="act-2018-055"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.12">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b669bb19-7971-4416-bf78-1f9e97e0eef9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>12</no><heading guid="_c892342f-652d-4ee6-81f7-7e3725fe7297"
id="sec.12-he"><b>Minister may obtain advice</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting section 10, the Minister may
also, in exercising functions under this Act, obtain and have regard to
advice, recommendations or other information provided to the Minister by a
person or body that the Minister considers relevant.</txt></block></level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e8f352b5-3ab7-44c5-8fd1-4fca7dcadea1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_bec4de48-e801-4bce-bf72-6efc52ac8011"
id="pt.3-he"><b>Miscellaneous</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.13">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7c59d360-5ed1-45bc-a98f-9de0073daef2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>13</no><heading guid="_f6e1efcf-0271-4b02-beda-c77536f9d5a2"
id="sec.13-he"><b>Delegation</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_58433f54-27a9-4986-b0d2-d9f91b10bd5c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may delegate the exercise of any
function of the Minister under this Act (other than this power of delegation)
to&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0c4a57ad-3e67-438d-bca0-38f2e0a1cac8" id="sec.13-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the head of a Public Service agency,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a6633d48-4739-4b79-a289-84fcee1d3cf5" id="sec.13-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any other person employed in a Public Service
agency.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2000c990-8cc5-4d99-b95b-edbb481afb82"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A delegate may subdelegate a delegated function
to another person employed in a Public Service agency.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f346a965-6e1f-45bc-98ea-de50e68f0dce"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section, <defterm type="definition"
guid="_0ee31b15-1085-4cfb-a043-4c48df115e6d"
id="sec.13-ssec.3-def.head"><b><i>head</i></b></defterm> of a Public Service
agency and <defterm type="definition"
guid="_aeb070f7-2a56-4108-843f-db46796d145c"
id="sec.13-ssec.3-def.PublicServiceagency"><b><i>Public Service
agency</i></b></defterm> have the same meanings as in the <legref type="act"
jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-2013-040"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Employment Act
2013</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.14">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6d80bd6c-c48f-45ce-b4b4-537af3b1be06"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>14</no><heading guid="_32c8cf31-952e-4533-8162-2183d3796d05"
id="sec.14-he"><b>Annual reports relating to Digital Restart
Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a2f69f3f-0524-435c-b52e-2a2a1da90c78"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is to produce a report relating to
the Fund each year (being a year commencing on 1 July).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8e6770e5-ea8e-461a-b71d-fba0cfda0956"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The report is to be in the form determined by the
Treasurer and include the following information&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1278aea4-2bb1-43bb-9afd-c8d95e418b3f" id="sec.14-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">details of payments into the Fund during the year
to which the report relates,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_dc24d069-8647-4668-ad8d-19c1805a6664" id="sec.14-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">details of payments from the Fund during the year
to which the report relates, including, where money has been paid to fund all
or part of the cost of a project, the following details in respect of that
project&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_df08aded-30ed-456d-b610-7ca1b07ee364"
id="sec.14-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the name of the project,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_bf148677-7461-4a7b-a39e-d12b9fc895c4"
id="sec.14-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the government agency, person or body responsible
for delivering the project,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_bb310dc4-f847-411b-a17b-801542042af2"
id="sec.14-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.iii">
<no>(iii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the total cost of the
project,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9082f266-f92e-4ca9-822b-32e3569788fd"
id="sec.14-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.iv">
<no>(iv)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the amount of money paid from the Fund in respect
of the project,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_51ba73f4-0532-4d0a-b0d2-c99b1d1f7732"
id="sec.14-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.v">
<no>(v)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the date on which the project was completed or is
expected to be completed,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f7fb81d7-3f40-448d-89f9-45942d107a3c"
id="sec.14-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.vi">
<no>(vi)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the objectives of the project, including any
change to those objectives,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ff4365bc-0e79-4604-868f-b87cdb6acaf8"
id="sec.14-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.vii">
<no>(vii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">whether the project has or is likely to achieve
those objectives,</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_58700d9d-c162-4575-8d5e-e40c628deb6b" id="sec.14-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any other information determined by the
Treasurer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9fb8e287-ed3b-481f-8738-67a7fe79b98f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The report is also to include an audit of the
Fund by the Auditor-General (including a report of the Auditor-General on
whether the payments from the Fund have been made in accordance with this
Act).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_42be6c56-5a67-40e6-90e5-a9bac1619735"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The report is to be made publicly available
within 6 months after the end of the year to which it
relates.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.15">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0653c35f-cdc1-4061-86dc-cb97a6ebfc36"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.15"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>15</no><heading guid="_83b911d9-e5bc-427c-9c3f-80c5b4dcb042"
id="sec.15-he"><b>Act to bind Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown in right of New South
Wales and, in so far as the legislative power of the Parliament of New South
Wales permits, the Crown in all its other capacities.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.16">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b22bd457-4458-482f-a1aa-fec55df426f8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>16</no><heading guid="_13d4ce5c-8911-41cf-9ee6-6502be685d2b"
id="sec.16-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.16-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_06c62a8b-25dd-42ac-bafb-f1e4c00d0e04"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.16-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_09b674da-8bff-470e-bd90-d9e7507f9f32"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations may contain provisions of a
savings or transitional nature consequent on the enactment of this Act or any
Act that amends this Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.17">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_daedb14a-5251-46d2-a5d7-ad8fd5b58813"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.17"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>17</no><heading guid="_25910ae5-f0ce-4687-9d29-838f2e303188"
id="sec.17-he"><b>Review of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.17-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_148f73ff-833c-4266-a5f8-0ad53550ff55"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.17-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is to review this Act to determine
whether the policy objectives of the Act remain valid and whether the terms of
the Act remain appropriate for securing the objectives.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.17-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_01af58be-c6c4-498e-9d57-7273ef95c034"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.17-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The review is to be undertaken as soon as
possible after the period of 5 years from the commencement of this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.17-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a15b30c7-c82d-4c41-a2c2-80ce31742cc3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.17-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A report on the outcome of the review is to be
tabled in each House of Parliament within 6 months after the end of the period
of 5 years.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>
</content>


